# Emre OS GPT and plugin

Custom GPT stays live until ChatGPT retires it (scheduled 11 Dec 2026). Do not remove OpenAPI actions, switch Actions auth away from None, or stop accepting `api_key`.

When assistant behavior, payloads, or tools change, update all of:

- `custom-gpt/INSTRUCTIONS.md` (keep the `API_KEY` lines)
- `custom-gpt/KNOWLEDGE.md`
- `openapi/emre-hub-ai-actions.yaml`
- `src/lib/emre-os/playbook.ts` and `src/lib/emre-os/tools.ts`
- `plugin/emre-os/skills/emre-os/SKILL.md` and `references/payloads.md`

Tool names match the OpenAPI `operationId`s. The plugin server adds `api_key`; the model must not.
